                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6725cf7b-27d6-3139-936d-3b1e40f074b5",
                        "entry_id": "653769cb-e13a-3c59-8dd8-d7e799db88f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "paved"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ae6e5eb-46e7-42e9-a089-e9e083c419c9",
                                "sense_id": "6725cf7b-27d6-3139-936d-3b1e40f074b5",
                                "text": "По мощёному церко́вному двору́, ми́мо собо́ра, я пошёл к кры́тым галере́ям, что веду́т в го́ру.",
                                "translation": "Ivan Bunin",
                                "english": "Ivan Bunin"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba35fda9-4d02-403d-b191-9c4a9ac7870a",
                                "sense_id": "6725cf7b-27d6-3139-936d-3b1e40f074b5",
                                "text": "Внизу́ под ним беле́л мощёный двор с ча́хлой траво́й ме́жду камня́ми и торча́ли вверх ве́тви жи́дких дере́вьев.",
                                "translation": "Below him the paved yard showed white with scanty grass between the stones, and the branches of a few thin trees pointed upwards.",
                                "english": "Below him the paved yard showed white with scanty grass between the stones, and the branches of a few thin trees pointed upwards."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
